00:07:53.190 --> 00:08:00.170
Dad was listening in the car and and it shaped
her viewpoint to conservatism.

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:06.170
And he did that for so many of us and so many
around the country.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.870
I want to thank you.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.200
I appreciate you being on the program.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:15.870
I know I read your statement the other day,
and I know you said in the in the months ahead,

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.520
