00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.920
And we won't do it tonight, obviously.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:23.830
But when that when that time comes, we're
looking forward to hearing what your future

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:29.280
plans are and what you are planning to do.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:33.080
I have a funny feeling we're going to hear
a lot more from Donald Trump.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.899
My instincts are correct.

00:08:34.899 --> 00:08:41.449
Well, there's a lot to talk about, and our
country is a great place and we're going to

00:08:41.449 --> 00:08:45.870
