but we have a lot to talk about.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.990
But today is all about Rush, don't you think?

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:53.889
And so Hannity mentions there that growing
up as a little kid, Kayleigh McEnany, Trump's

00:08:53.889 --> 00:08:57.759
